to his boss. Getting praised by his boss makes him very happy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639770/extras/9098275c0b952667bad694324be5c047.avif?t=1739725066\" width=600 height=124 /></span>- - Around 65K Words! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 Love Interests </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Map Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mini-game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This game is more about bonds than romance</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mentions blood, homicide, trauma, and self-harm</i></strong></p>",
